ily: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">남원읍성 및 북문복원 등과 연계된 구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">남원역 광장 및 교차로를 정비하여 시민들에게 열린 휴게공간을 제공하고자</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">만인공원</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">광장 및 교차로개선 공사를 시행할 예정에 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2.&nbsp;이에 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">좋은 아이디어와 디자인을 선정하고자 공모내용을 알려드리오니 관심 있는 대학생들의 많은 참여를 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">공모분야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">만인공원</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">광장 및 교차로개선 디자인 공모</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;